{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふたたび東京に上陸しましたひめたんです(`・・)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっきーな(柏幸奈chan)に\nひめたんを見てるとお菓子買ってあげたくなるー\nひめたんを見てるとおもちゃ買ってあげたくなるー\nひめたんを見てると風船あげたくなるー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われちゃった(ω)きゃは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー最近ＤＤかなりん(中田花菜chan)が\nひめきゅんらしいの(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみん(高山一実chan)もかなりんも大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめきゅんの人に悪い人はおらんっ!!!\nそうですよねみなさん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかてかよく考えてみたら乃木坂の出席番号..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山→中田→中元"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、中元→永島→西野→能條の流れを続けて呼んでみると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかもとながしまにしのーじょう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわーい繋がったー＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木メンとのこーんな何気ない会話が好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは牡蠣(かき)の土手鍋って知ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当然!広島の名産品じゃないですかー♪\n好きすきっ(*/ω＼*)\n今の時期に広島行ったら絶対おすすめぢゃーあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはアニメはなにが好きかな？\nそしてそのアニメのストーリーではどこ辺りの話が好きかなーん？(^^♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃいときはアニメよくみとったけど、最近全然見とらん('・・`)ｹﾄﾞ\nけいおんの曲は割とうたえるんですよー♪\nオススメのアニメとかってありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメな漫画ってありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画も最近あんまり読んでない('・・`)\n少女漫画にハマりたい時期があったりもした!\nひめたんの周りはワンピースふぁん多いっけなー。\n何かオススメな漫画ありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか野球は二回でてたけどバスケはどうなん？\nHPの見たら結構できてるように見えたけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん２年間だけバスケ同好会に入っとったんよー。\nぢゃけシュートする時のフォームはよく褒めてもらえる(*^^*)/"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/basketball.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際シュート率はだめだめだけれども。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会に広島の名産品持って行っていいかな？\nこれぞっていうお土産があったら教えてね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほええー。広島人だと逆に広島土産食べんけ嬉しいっ\n何がいいかねー？ひめたん的には「あげもみじ」オススメなんぢゃけど\nシワシワになっちゃうおそらく('・ω・`)ちーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンという名のお兄ちゃん？も乃木坂ふぁみりーに入れて～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぇるかんむ(o>ω<o)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、コメントできるのにサボっているファンに\n何か言いたいことありますか？（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーん寂しーい!!!\nコメントサボったらひめたん悲しいじゃないですかー。\nひめたんブログサボってもいいのー(>_<)？\n...とかゆって。わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃは(ω)★ってなんやねんww\nごまかしかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃは(ω)★←わら\nみなさんも困ったことがおこったら、とりあえずにゃはりましょう。\nにゃはー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまさらだけど、ひめたんを推していってもいい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜んでー(*/ω＼*)!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/12/cimg0260.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりん（永島聖羅chan）ひめたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}